WEBVTT

00:31:27.430 --> 00:31:30.997
And that is part of this battle, I think.

00:31:32.363 --> 00:31:33.530
AG: Yeah, I agree.

00:31:33.563 --> 00:31:40.263
And another common source of opposition

00:31:40.697 --> 00:31:45.497
to what governments are doing now
has to do with the fear,

00:31:45.530 --> 00:31:48.763
both in the US and elsewhere,
on the part of some,

00:31:48.797 --> 00:31:55.363
that jobs might be lost
in this transition toward a green economy.

00:31:56.463 --> 00:31:57.630
You and I both know

00:31:57.663 --> 00:31:59.963
that there are a lot of jobs
that can be created.

00:31:59.963 --> 00:32:02.030
But let me put the question to you.